# Root-level folder the Claude desktop app drops delivered files into
# (added 2026-09-06). Appeared untracked at the root of this PUBLIC repo,
# which is the same structural setup as the Aug 20 incident: a file arrives
# in the repo root from an out-of-band process and gets swept in by a
# `git add -A`. Contents are working deliverables, not portfolio content.
Claude outputs/

