# Per-session handoff prompts (added 2026-09-03). These are working notes
# between sessions, not portfolio content, and this repo root is shared by
# more than one project -- an untracked prompt from one project shows up as
# noise in the other's `git status`. Their durable content lives in the
# Claude project docs and in STATUS.md, so nothing is lost by keeping them
# out of git. No such file was ever tracked, so this takes effect
# immediately -- no `git rm --cached` needed.
*session-prompt*.md
